{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國人氣男團Stray Kids，昨日(25日)推出第4張日文迷你專輯《SUIATSU》，首日出貨量已破100萬張，相當厲害。8位成員同日突襲東京涉谷，到其期間限定店簽名，引起一陣哄動！</p><p>此外，8子將亮相下周一（30日）播出的日本綜藝節目《閒聊007》做嘉賓，與經典電影《死亡筆記》男星藤原龍也見面。藤原更自爆受到10歲兒子影響，成為Stray Kids粉絲。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.454207+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:03:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:57:37.279357+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:18.004785+00:00","content_hash":"96566d5e4906d97b25a9344d11025a745c0e3d935ba7f23652ab0be062b8083b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.454207+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}